//    linkText: Label for the link button, or ""
//    image:    Optional filename in images/News/, or "" for none
//              e.g. "2025-acsnano.jpg"
//
//  NEWS_START_DATE — start date ("YYYY-MM-DD") for the "Years" counter
//  shown on the News page stats strip. That counter is NOT based on
//  today's real calendar date — it's based on the most recent date
//  among the NEWS entries below, so the whole site stays deterministic
//  and you can preview a "future" state of the site just by adding a
//  further-dated entry here. The counter hides itself while it would
//  show 0 (i.e. before this start date has been reached).
// ============================================================

